<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry good, demand moderate.</p>
<p>For the week to date, 16,400 head confirmed including 900 head or about five percent contracted or formulated cattle. Confirmed - none</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
